 Super+Return   terminal            Super+D        app launcher
 Super+Shift+M  next cat mode       Super+C        cat fact
 Super+U        unlock keyboard     Super+Shift+E  leave

 Try:  catmode salma    catfact    pspsps    catkeys test

 To install: run 'sudo archinstall', and when it asks whether to chroot into
 the new system say no, then run 'sudo kittyfy /mnt'.

